          },
          {
            "text": "fact that the bipartisan 21st century road to housing act has",
            "statement": "sha256:352d5324e2a626955d657ec05675cf2e6ecc5fdd42897b4715a09b7203a77038"
          },
          {
            "text": "announced that the 21st century road to housing act",
